cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you refer to this formalization, please cite the paper below.
title: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of "Mundlak Regressions in Multiway Panels with
  Irregular Support: Failure, Repair, and Inference"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 development, with Mathlib, stating and proving every labelled result
  of the paper and its supplemental materials. The development compiles with no
  sorry, and every checked declaration depends only on propext,
  Classical.choice and Quot.sound.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/djachoc/multiway-mundlak-lean
